* Mixed devices: physical phone controls followed by keypad entry.
Goal: Transfer a call
. Goal: Start transfer
.. Look at <transfer button>
.. Touch <transfer button>
. Goal: Enter extension
.. Hands to keypad
.. Recall <extension>
.. Type <extension>
.. Verify <extension> is displayed
. Goal: Complete transfer
.. Hands to phone controls
.. Look at <complete transfer button>
.. Touch <complete transfer button>
.. Verify call is transferred
